r />\n<br />", "canonical": "https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/mma"}, "329": {"id": 329, "title": "UFC Prelim Fight Lines | MMA Betting | FanDuel", "description": "Find the latest UFC Prelim Fight Line & betting odds at FanDuel Sportsbook. Sign up now to bet on MMA with America\u2019s number one sportsbook!", "footer": "<h1>UFC Odds: Prelim Card</h1>\n<p>Bet on the most up-to-date MMA odds, lines, and spreads with FanDuel Sportsbook. Betting includes UFC preliminary fights. Bet on who will win the fight, how many rounds will the fight go, and will the fight end in a KO/TKO, submission, or judge decision.</p>"}, "371": {"id": 371, "title": "Bellator Odds: MMA Betting Odds & Props | FanDuel Sportsbook", "footer": "<h1>Bellator Betting Odds</h1>\n<p>Bet on the most up-to-date Bellator odds, lines, and spreads with FanDuel Sportsbook.</p>"}, "380": {"id": 380, "title": "UFC Odds: MMA Betting Odds & Props | FanDuel Sportsbook", "description": "Find the latest MMA betting odds at FanDuel Sportsbook. Sign up now to bet on MMA with America\u2019s number one sportsbook!", "footer": "<a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/\">Sportsbook Odds</a> / <strong>MMA Betting Odds</strong>\n<br />\n<br />\n<h1>UFC Odds</h1>\n<p>Popularity for MMA is growing rapidly, with UFC leading the way. MMA has never been more exciting and now you can bet on the most up-to-date MMA and UFC odds, lines, and spreads with FanDuel Sportsbook. Our Sportsbook offers MMA and UFC fans the best opportunity to bet on upcoming fights.</p>\n\n<h2>Popular Types of MMA Betting Odds</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fight Moneylines: Betting on who will win the fight</li>\n<li>Round Betting: Betting which round the fight ends</li>\n<li>Method of Victory: Betting on the winner and how the fight ends</li>\n<li>Quickest Fight: Betting on which fight of the night will last the shortest amount of time</li>\n</ul>\n<br />\n<h2>How Do You Read and Bet on UFC Fight Odds</h2>\n<p>The favorite is always listed with UFC odds that include a minus sign (-) and the underdog is listed with MMA odds that include a plus sign (+). When placing a bet on round betting, you are wagering on a fighter to win the match outright in that particular round. So if you bet on Daniel Cormier to win in round three, he must win the fight in the third round in order for the bet to be a winner. There are options to bet on individual rounds or various groupings of rounds, and you can also bet on which fight will end the quickest.</p>\n\n<h2>Betting on UFC Moneylines</h2>\n<p>A moneyline bet, also known as a straight bet in sports betting, is a wager on who you think will win the fight. The payout will change based on the moneyline odds, which differs for the favorite and underdog. If you bet on the favorite, the odds value is the amount you must wager to win $100, and for the underdog, you must wager $100 to win that amount.</p>\n<p>For example, let\u2019s say Francis Ngannou is favored at -145 odds and Jon Jones is the underdog at +130 odds. A $145 bet on Ngannou would pay you $245, your original $145 bet plus $100 in winnings. A $100 bet on Jones would pay out $230, your original $100 stake plus $130 in winnings.</p>\n<h2>Things to Know When Betting on UFC Odds</h2>\n<p>Should a contest be postponed, bets will stand if the rescheduled event occurs within 48 hours. Otherwise, all bets in relation to the contest will be void.</p>\n<p>Stakes may be refunded before the original contest if requested. In the event of a 'no contest' being declared, all bets will be made void.</p>\n<p>Should there be a substitution for one of the fighters, bets on the original contest will be void.</p>\n<p>Now that you know the basics for betting on UFC go check out the the betting odds tables above for the upcoming UFC fights. Also for more rules regarding UFC odds can be found in the FanDuel Sportsbook House Rules.</p>\n<br />\n<br />\n<h2><strong>Most Popular Betting Odds</strong></h2>\n<p>Along with our UFC Odds, FanDuel Sportsbook is also the number one sportsbook for betting on all sports in the United States.</p>\n\n<p>Betting odds for the most popular sports can be found below:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/nfl\"><u>NFL Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/mlb\"><u>MLB Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/nba\"><u>NBA Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/nhl\"><u>NHL Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/ncaaf\"><u>NCAA Football Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/navigation/ncaab\"><u>NCAA Basketball Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/soccer\"><u>Soccer Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/golf\"><u>PGA Odds</u></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sportsbook.fanduel.com/mma\"><u>UFC Odds</u></a></li>\n</ul>"}, "381": {"id": 381}, "523": {"id": 523, "title": "PFL Odds: MMA Betting Odds & Props | FanDuel Sportsbook", "footer": "<h1>PFL Betting Odds</h1>\n<p>Bet on the most up-to-date PFL odds, lines, and spreads with FanDuel Sportsbook.</p>"}, "2814": {"id": 2814}, "3109": {"id": 3109}}, "dimensions": {"jurisdiction": "USA", "region": "VA", "language": "en"}, "tabs": {"69": {"id": 69, "title": "UFC", "cards": [{"id": 43}], "seo": 88}, "277": {"id": 277, "title": "UFC Prelims", "cards": [{"id": 4116}], "seo": 329}, "331": {"id": 331, "title": "UFC Main Card", "cards": [{"id": 5924}, {"id": 4114}, {"id": 4115}], "seo": 380}}, "tabsDisplayOrder": [331, 277, 69], "defaultTab": 69, "cards": {"43": {"attachmentsDependent": true, "attachmentsFullyLoaded": true, "id": 43, "type": "COUPON", "title": "Upcoming Fights", "coupons": [{"id": 7834, "isCollapsed": false, "isCollapsible": false}, {"id": 49, "isCollapsed": false, "isCollapsible": false}], "hasAttachments": true}, "722": {"attachmentsDependent": true, "attachmentsFullyLoaded": true, "id": 722